            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arikw iyo gatewe, karakura, kakaba kanini, kakaruta ibirimwa vyose, kagashamika amashami manini, kand’ inyoni zo mu kirere zishobora kwārika ivyāri mu gitūtu cako.",
          "type": "text",
